ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja443:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja443:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja443:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja443:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja443:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja443:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja443:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja443:0.2": "Dasakanipāta ", "ja443:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja443:0.4": "5. Cūḷabodhijātaka ", "ja443:1.1": "“Yo te imaṁ visālakkhiṁ, ", "ja443:1.2": "piyaṁ sammhitabhāsiniṁ; ", "ja443:1.3": "Ādāya balā gaccheyya, ", "ja443:1.4": "kiṁ nu kayirāsi brāhmaṇa”. ", "ja443:2.1": "“Uppajje me na mucceyya, ", "ja443:2.2": "na me mucceyya jīvato; ", "ja443:2.3": "Rajaṁva vipulā vuṭṭhi, ", "ja443:2.4": "khippameva nivāraye”. ", "ja443:3.1": "“Yannu pubbe vikatthittho, ", "ja443:3.2": "balamhiva apassito; ", "ja443:3.3": "Svajja tuṇhikato dāni, ", "ja443:3.4": "saṅghāṭiṁ sibbamacchasi”. ", "ja443:4.1": "“Uppajji me na muccittha, ", "ja443:4.2": "na me muccittha jīvato; ", "ja443:4.3": "Rajaṁva vipulā vuṭṭhi, ", "ja443:4.4": "khippameva nivārayiṁ”. ", "ja443:5.1": "“Kiṁ te uppajji no mucci, ", "ja443:5.2": "kiṁ te na mucci jīvato; ", "ja443:5.3": "Rajaṁva vipulā vuṭṭhi, ", "ja443:5.4": "katamaṁ tvaṁ nivārayi”. ", "ja443:6.1": "“Yamhi jāte na passati, ", "ja443:6.2": "ajāte sādhu passati; ", "ja443:6.3": "So me uppajji no mucci, ", "ja443:6.4": "kodho dummedhagocaro. ", "ja443:7.1": "Yena jātena nandanti, ", "ja443:7.2": "amittā dukkhamesino; ", "ja443:7.3": "So me uppajji no mucci, ", "ja443:7.4": "kodho dummedhagocaro. ", "ja443:8.1": "Yasmiñca jāyamānamhi, ", "ja443:8.2": "sadatthaṁ nāvabujjhati; ", "ja443:8.3": "So me uppajji no mucci, ", "ja443:8.4": "kodho dummedhagocaro. ", "ja443:9.1": "Yenābhibhūto kusalaṁ jahāti, ", "ja443:9.2": "Parakkare vipulañcāpi atthaṁ; ", "ja443:9.3": "Sa bhīmaseno balavā pamaddī, ", "ja443:9.4": "Kodho mahārāja na me amuccatha. ", "ja443:10.1": "Kaṭṭhasmiṁ matthamānasmiṁ, ", "ja443:10.2": "Pāvako nāma jāyati; ", "ja443:10.3": "Tameva kaṭṭhaṁ ḍahati, ", "ja443:10.4": "Yasmā so jāyate gini. ", "ja443:11.1": "Evaṁ mandassa posassa, ", "ja443:11.2": "bālassa avijānato; ", "ja443:11.3": "Sārambhā jāyate kodho, ", "ja443:11.4": "sopi teneva ḍayhati. ", "ja443:12.1": "Aggīva tiṇakaṭṭhasmiṁ, ", "ja443:12.2": "kodho yassa pavaḍḍhati; ", "ja443:12.3": "Nihīyati tassa yaso, ", "ja443:12.4": "kāḷapakkheva candimā. ", "ja443:13.1": "Anedho dhūmaketūva, ", "ja443:13.2": "kodho yassūpasammati; ", "ja443:13.3": "Āpūrati tassa yaso, ", "ja443:13.4": "sukkapakkheva candimā”ti. ", "ja443:14.1": "Cūḷabodhijātakaṁ pañcamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja443:0.1": "", "ja443:0.2": "", "ja443:0.3": "", "ja443:0.4": "", "ja443:1.1": "", "ja443:1.2": "sammhitabhāsiniṁ → sammillabhāsiniṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); sammillahāsiniṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja443:1.3": "", "ja443:1.4": "", "ja443:2.1": "Uppajje → uppajja (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja443:2.2": "", "ja443:2.3": "", "ja443:2.4": "nivāraye → nivārayiṁ (mr) ", "ja443:3.1": "vikatthittho → vikatthito (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja443:3.2": "", "ja443:3.3": "Svajja → svājja (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | tuṇhikato → tuṇhīkako (bj); tuṇhikkhako (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja443:3.4": "", "ja443:4.1": "", "ja443:4.2": "", "ja443:4.3": "", "ja443:4.4": "", "ja443:5.1": "", "ja443:5.2": "", "ja443:5.3": "", "ja443:5.4": "", "ja443:6.1": "", "ja443:6.2": "", "ja443:6.3": "", "ja443:6.4": "", "ja443:7.1": "", "ja443:7.2": "", "ja443:7.3": "", "ja443:7.4": "", "ja443:8.1": "", "ja443:8.2": "", "ja443:8.3": "", "ja443:8.4": "", "ja443:9.1": "", "ja443:9.2": "", "ja443:9.3": "", "ja443:9.4": "", "ja443:10.1": "matthamānasmiṁ → manthamānasmiṁ (pts-vp-pli1); maddamānasmiṁ (mr) ", "ja443:10.2": "", "ja443:10.3": "", "ja443:10.4": "", "ja443:11.1": "", "ja443:11.2": "", "ja443:11.3": "Sārambhā → sārabbhā (mr) ", "ja443:11.4": "", "ja443:12.1": "", "ja443:12.2": "", "ja443:12.3": "", "ja443:12.4": "", "ja443:13.1": "Anedho → anindho (bj, mr); anindo (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja443:13.2": "", "ja443:13.3": "", "ja443:13.4": "", "ja443:14.1": "Cūḷabodhijātakaṁ → cullabodhijātakaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja443:0.1": "", "ja443:0.2": "", "ja443:0.3": "", "ja443:0.4": "", "ja443:1.1": "bj30.358, ms22J_1961, msdiv49, pts-vp-pli4.24", "ja443:1.2": "", "ja443:1.3": "", "ja443:1.4": "", "ja443:2.1": "ms22J_1962, msdiv50, sya27.280", "ja443:2.2": "", "ja443:2.3": "", "ja443:2.4": "", "ja443:3.1": "ms22J_1963, msdiv51, pts-vp-pli4.25", "ja443:3.2": "", "ja443:3.3": "", "ja443:3.4": "", "ja443:4.1": "ms22J_1964, msdiv52, ndp22.200", "ja443:4.2": "", "ja443:4.3": "", "ja443:4.4": "", "ja443:5.1": "ms22J_1965, msdiv53", "ja443:5.2": "", "ja443:5.3": "", "ja443:5.4": "", "ja443:6.1": "dr27.279, ms22J_1966, msdiv54, pts-vp-pli4.26", "ja443:6.2": "", "ja443:6.3": "", "ja443:6.4": "", "ja443:7.1": "ms22J_1967, msdiv55", "ja443:7.2": "", "ja443:7.3": "", "ja443:7.4": "", "ja443:8.1": "csp1ed22.208, csp2ed22.208, ms22J_1968, msdiv56", "ja443:8.2": "", "ja443:8.3": "", "ja443:8.4": "", "ja443:9.1": "ms22J_1969, msdiv57", "ja443:9.2": "", "ja443:9.3": "", "ja443:9.4": "", "ja443:10.1": "ms22J_1970, msdiv58", "ja443:10.2": "", "ja443:10.3": "", "ja443:10.4": "", "ja443:11.1": "bj30.360, ms2